:::writing{variant="chat_message" id="18472"}
Tommy, I know you're trying, and I love you. But my heart still doesn't feel safe. Can you just hold my face, look me in the eyes, tell me I'm safe, tell me we're okay, and promise me you'll protect my heart? Please don't explain or defend anything right now. I just need you to lead me back to feeling safe so we can go on this trip together.
:::
